WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.083
Start on Home. Add Item is in the top card on Home.

00:00:03.083 --> 00:00:05.166
Select Add Item. Select it. The form opens.

00:00:05.166 --> 00:00:07.833
The Add Item form. The form opens, ready for a new item.

00:00:07.833 --> 00:00:11.250
Item name is required. It is the only required field.

00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:16.083
Add a photo and details. Add a photo, then fill in what you
know.

00:00:16.083 --> 00:00:20.500
Saved to your Vault. After you save, you land in your Vault.
